:: Widgets DoLX Changelog [widget]
<<widget "DoLXChangelog">>
	<div class="dolx-changelog">
		<div class="dolx-changelog-hero">
			<span class="dolx-changelog-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128220;</span>
			<div>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-label">PATCH NOTES</div>
				<h1>DoL X-Change <span>v0.20.13b</span></h1>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-apk-note"><strong>Official X-Change APK:</strong> Join the DoL Modding server and check the dedicated <a href="https://discord.com/channels/675158131688603721/1512272787572785162" target="_blank">X-Change Channel</a>.</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="dolx-changelog-release-link" href="https://gitgud.io/Akoz/dol-xchange/-/releases" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span> View the full changelog and all releases <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon new" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span> Changes and Additions</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Updated to vanilla version 0.5.11.7
		</li>
		<li>Updated to DoLP version 0.757
		</li>
		<li>Merged RBE version 0.5.3
		</li>
		<li>Added neutral player pronouns
		<ul>
			<li>Player pronoun preferences now control how the game refers to the PC, including he/him, she/her, and they/them pronouns with matching grammar and gendered terms.
			</li>
			<li>A non-binary identity can use neutral, feminine, or masculine pronouns according to the player's preference.
			</li>
			<li>When multiple pronoun sets are accepted, the game can select between them based on the configured dynamic mode, current presentation, body, clothing, appearance, or posture. Neutral pronouns provide the fallback.
			</li>
			<li>Existing saves are migrated safely.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added trans identity dialogue and pill interactions
		<ul>
			<li>Trans PCs can explain their identity to students and Robin and gain recognised access to their preferred changing room.
			</li>
			<li>Robin, Avery, and school delinquents can react after learning that the PC is trans.
			</li>
			<li>Added new supportive and dominant pill interactions.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Expanded gender identity preferences
		<ul>
			<li>Height, hair, chest, ass, and genitals can now gradually move towards the player's preferred choices.
			</li>
			<li>Stable dual genitals are supported without requiring an active X-Change pill.
			</li>
			<li>Disabled body topics remain disabled, and existing saves migrate safely.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Expanded chastity
		<ul>
			<li>Added more chastity-aware changing-room taunts and general body comments, with distinct reactions to belts, cages, and trapped parasites.
			</li>
			<li>When Whitney's chastity rule applies to a penis-less body, Whitney can now fit a constantly stimulating dildo chastity belt.
			</li>
			<li>Being caught by the Pound can now result in a forced chastity device, with a higher chance when the player's body does not match how they present.
			</li>
			<li>Any chastity device now drastically slows arousal fade, can occasionally spike arousal, and reduces the relief gained from orgasming while locked.
			</li>
			<li>Flat and small shrinking cages now also raise minimum arousal while worn.
			</li>
			<li>Added a dildo chastity belt for vaginas, providing constant internal stimulation and increased sensitivity.
			</li>
			<li>Chastity-trapped parasites from swarm encounters now raise minimum arousal, stimulate the player more often, and can be properly cured at the hospital.
			</li>
			<li>Jordan now refuses to remove a monk or priest's chastity device when it belongs to someone else, the player's personal standing is insufficient, or their reputation in town is too poor. A new "Pray for guidance" option can improve the latter two over time.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added a variant to the street seduction event
		<ul>
			<li>The well-dressed man on a bench may now be offering an honest, no-strings-attached encounter instead of always hiding a camera in the hotel room.
			</li>
			<li>His opening description subtly hints at which version was selected.
			</li>
			<li>Higher Skulduggery increases the chance of the honest version, allowing perceptive characters to benefit from their awareness instead of being consistently locked out of the scene.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Improved the X-Change Tester
		<ul>
			<li>X-Change Tests now estimate remaining pill time in hours, days, or weeks.
			</li>
			<li>The Traits panel remembers and updates the improved reading until the transformation ends.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Gwylan's fluid samples
		<ul>
			<li>Gwylan's collection requests now provide two samples when the same NPC orgasms twice in one encounter.
			</li>
			<li>One orgasm still provides one sample, and further orgasms do not increase the reward.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Gwylan's pet names
		<ul>
			<li>Added transformation-specific pet names for bunny, bear, and water dragon forms.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated the brothel
		<ul>
			<li>Fluids can now be collected through quick actions.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added more sexual-event bypasses for PCs who are too innocent or drunk to participate.
		</li>
		<li>Added a new innocence reaction
		<ul>
			<li>Innocent PCs may panic when losing their handholding virginity.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Rebalancing</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Tweaked body-size rendering
		<ul>
			<li>Sidebar rendering has been adjusted to look better across different body sizes.
			</li>
			<li>"Scale sidebar image to body size" is now disabled by default and can still be enabled under Rendering.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Tweaked fame changes while masked
		<ul>
			<li>A mask completely blocks fame gain and loss in a category below 500 fame.
			</li>
			<li>From 500 to 999 fame, a mask only halves the change.
			</li>
			<li>At 1000 fame or higher, the player is too recognisable for a mask to conceal them.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Tweaked Fallen Angel during purging confession
		<ul>
			<li>Fallen Angels now lose Purity regardless of manifestation level, but the penalty is gentler than before.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Improved Continue and Breeder pill behaviour
		<ul>
			<li>Added an optional cap that prevents Continue from stacking transformation time indefinitely.
			</li>
			<li>Continue can be safely removed from permanent transformations without undoing their permanence.
			</li>
			<li>Breeder and Omega orgasm denial now reduce pleasure and apply gentler, spaced-out Stress rather than repeatedly chaining penalties.
			</li>
			<li>Fake Breeder remains infertile without disabling Omega.
			</li>
			<li>Hyper Fertility now supports vaginal pregnancy, Omega anal pregnancy, and pregnancies sired by the player.
			</li>
			<li>Related orgasm and pregnancy options are now grouped under the Breeder and Fertility settings.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated gloves
		<ul>
			<li>Losing handholding virginity is prevented while the player is wearing gloves.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Made "Begrudged" clearer in the Identity settings.
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Fixes and Improvements</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Fixed updated UI persistence
		<ul>
			<li>The selected theme now persists correctly across save loads, including saves created during an ongoing game.
			</li>
			<li>Select Updated UI in Decomod, advance one passage, and save to store the chosen theme.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed combat scenes ending after the first turn
		<ul>
			<li>Fixed 36 encounters across multiple locations that could jump directly to their ending after the first action, regardless of the opponent's health or pleasure.
			</li>
			<li>Affected combat scenes now continue until their proper ending conditions are met.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Photo High Alley combat
		<ul>
			<li>Removed a redundant variable and added the missing combat cleanup.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed combat submission text using a stale NPC description during beast encounters.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed named NPC dodge chance corruption
		<ul>
			<li>All named NPCs now start with a valid dodge chance before modifiers are applied, preventing the issue from recurring.
			</li>
			<li>Existing saves may show the warning once if an invalid value was already saved. Use "Reset Corrupted Variables" when prompted; regenerated NPC data will remain valid.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed save loading
		<ul>
			<li>The player's saved skin colour is now restored instead of a temporary colour used while cloning NPC data.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the dancing UI button to match the masturbate UI.
		</li>
		<li>Gated orgasm moans behind the Moan/Grunt setting.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed rimming options appearing when the PC is in an impossible position.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed a gender mismatch during car pill-whoring scenes.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed biking skill gains
		<ul>
			<li>Biking now awards its skill point correctly.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed biking event times
		<ul>
			<li>A cycling event intended for the morning no longer also occurs at night.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Whitney reacting to undiscovered X-Change use
		<ul>
			<li>Whitney's maths-class dialogue now references the player's X-Change use only after Whitney has discovered it.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed redundant NPC generation when the black wolf comments on their chub.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Poppy's pregnancy reveal
		<ul>
			<li>Poppy now checks the baby's actual paternity before claiming to be the father.
			</li>
			<li>If another character or creature caused the pregnancy, the player correctly explains that the child is not Poppy's, and Poppy responds supportively without claiming it.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed X-Change random hair colours
		<ul>
			<li>Dye Harder's temporary <code>tmp0</code> and <code>tmp1</code> colour-picker entries are excluded from random hair-colour selection.
			</li>
			<li>Rerolls can no longer produce white hair labelled "color picker slot."
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed adult shop payouts
		<ul>
			<li>The adult shop no longer sometimes pays &#163;0 or an incorrect amount.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed cafe income
		<ul>
			<li>Cafe waiter shifts now consistently include the &#163;12 hourly wage, whether or not a customer tips.
			</li>
			<li>Shifts also advance the full amount of time correctly.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed mouth-to-ass actions
		<ul>
			<li>Moving the player's mouth to a female partner's ass no longer resets to "mouth is free" on the next turn or removes both pussy and ass options for the rest of the encounter.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed menu tab crashes
		<ul>
			<li>Switching tabs in overlay menus no longer throws an error or freezes the panel after opening a menu or changing a setting that refreshes the screen.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
	</div>
<</widget>>
